<title>UK: EIB drachma FRN has July 25 payment date - leads.</title>
<headline>EIB drachma FRN has July 25 payment date - leads.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Investment Bank's 20 billion drachma FRN will have a July 25 payment date, joint lead managers ABN AMRO Hoare Govett, Credito Italian and Citibank said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The deal was launched on Wednesday.</p>
<p>+ + +</p>
<p> AMT     20 BLN GRD   BASE	3M-ATHIBOR MATURITY    15.JUN.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     -85 BP    PAY DATE   *25.JUL.97</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 ISS PRICE  100.35    FULL FEES   0.50</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 REOFFER    PAR	 GOV LAW     GREECE</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (M) 1-5	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/GR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.15	SELL CONC  0.35</p>
<p> NOTES	*SHORT FIRST COUPON, SET AT 11.25 PCT.</p>
<p>		ISSUED OFF DEBT ISSUANCE PROGRAMME.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
